WEBVTT

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:01.950
Fiscal Motive.

00:00:01.900 --> 00:00:09.937
The Parliamentary Budget Officer calculated that expanding MAID would save the government 149 million dollars annually.

00:00:09.937 --> 00:00:18.062
A 2025 systemic analysis projected 1.273 trillion dollars in savings by 2047.

00:00:18.062 --> 00:00:23.787
The state is financially incentivized to end the lives of its most expensive citizens.
